# Brineborn Cutthroat: "Whenever you cast a spell during an opponent's turn, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature" (CR 603.2, 601.2i, 405.2). In
# Bot2's upkeep Bot1 casts a Lightning Bolt: the trigger goes on the stack above the Bolt and resolves first, so the Cutthroat has its counter while
# the Bolt still waits. A second Bolt in response triggers again: two counters, a 4/3, and both Bolts hit Bot2.

